      "text": "A consumer can enforce a written warranty by simply presenting the warranty card or official receipt together with the product to the immediate seller; no other documents are required. If the manufacturer or distributor fails to honor the warranty, the retailer (the appliance shop) is subsidiarily liable and must shoulder the costs to fulfill the warranty.",
