      "component_id": "concern_001",
      "text": "Under the Omnibus Rules, every employer must grant each employee a rest period of at least twenty‑four consecutive hours after six consecutive normal work days. The rest day must be given as a weekly rest, and the employer cannot require work on that day unless one of the specific emergencies or exceptional conditions listed in the rule applies.",
