      "text": "When an online purchase arrives in the wrong size, the consumer may demand repair, replacement, or refund under the Consumer Act as applied by JAO 24‑03. The e‑retailer can require the return of the wrongly delivered item at no cost to the consumer, provided the return is made within a reasonable period.",
