      "text": "A grocery store must give the exact change to a consumer; it is unlawful to shortchange even a small amount. If the store fails or refuses to give the proper change, the Department of Trade and Industry may order the establishment to pay the total shortchanged amount to the complainant in addition to any applicable fine.",
